{
  "name": "dsh-self-heal",
  "version": "0.3.0",
  "description": "DSH 失控自愈：复读或墙钟超时熔断后自动压缩对话并重试续跑；模型没把话说完（只思考不说话，或说了一半就停）时，先压缩上下文腾地方、再注入提醒让它接着写完。挂在 host 组合上，覆盖所有会话与子代理的模型调用。",
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "self-heal",
    "recovery",
    "loop-detection",
    "runaway"
  ],
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "files": [
    "lib",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "scripts": {
    "test": "node --test test/detect.test.mjs test/integration.test.mjs test/recovery.test.mjs",
    "contract": "node test/contract-check.mjs",
    "diagnose": "node test/diagnose.mjs"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
